{
  "category": "Requiem Pokémon",
  "entries": [
    {
      "text": "DUSKULL can pass through any wall no matter how thick it may be. Once this POKéMON chooses a target, it will doggedly pursue the intended victim until the break of dawn.",
      "version": "ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "DUSKULL wanders lost among the deep darkness of midnight. There is an oft- told admonishment given to misbehaving children that this POKéMON will spirit away bad children who earn scoldings from their mothers.",
      "version": "sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "A glare from its single scarlet eye makes even burly grown-ups freeze in utter fear. It is a nocturnal POKéMON that roams about under the cloak of darkness.",
      "version": "emerald"
    },
    {
      "text": "Making itself invisible, it silently sneaks up to prey. It has the ability to slip through thick walls.",
      "version": "firered"
    },
    {
      "text": "Making itself invisible, it silently sneaks up to prey. It has the ability to slip through thick walls.",
      "version": "leafgreen"
    },
    {
      "text": "It doggedly pursues its prey wherever it goes. However, the chase is abandoned at sunrise.",
      "version": "diamond"
    },
    {
      "text": "It doggedly pursues its prey wherever it goes. However, the chase is abandoned at sunrise.",
      "version": "pearl"
    },
    {
      "text": "It loves the crying of children. It startles bad kids by passing through walls and making them cry.",
      "version": "platinum"
    },
    {
      "text": "If it finds bad children who won’t listen to their parents, it will spirit them away--or so it’s said.",
      "version": "heartgold"
    },
    {
      "text": "If it finds bad children who won’t listen to their parents, it will spirit them away--or so it’s said.",
